  <title type="string">Beyond the long argument with the colour blue</title>
  <description type="string">Dmitri Dubois-Ngata talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
